Read `.skills/dva-agentic-platform/SKILL.md` for full project context.

This is a multi-repo workspace (NOT a single repo) with 4 repos:
- dva-agentic-cli/ — Python CLI (`dva` command), 9 command groups
- dva-skills/ — Skills registry, 62 skills for project onboarding
- dva-mcp-servers/ — 8 Docker MCP servers (Bitbucket, Jira, Glean, Confluence, Memory, KG, Gateway, Proxy)
- dva-kg-infrastructure/ — Neo4j + LightRAG knowledge graph infra

Tech: Python 3.10+, Typer, Rich, Pydantic, FastMCP, httpx, Docker, Neo4j
MCP endpoints: 8126 (Bitbucket), 8127 (Glean), 8128 (Jira), 8129 (Confluence), 8130 (Memory), 8131 (KG)
Operations guide: docs/LOCAL_DEV_OPS_GUIDE.md
